        "note": "The Lean development in `supplement/lean` of that repository (Lean v4.29.1, release v3.0.1) contains the same one-step proof for 7/5. This repository is a port of that proof to Lean v4.36.0-rc2 and the Lean module system, restricted to the files the 7/5 one-step proof needs. The mathematical content of the proofs is unchanged; the port added module headers, renamed one deprecated import, made one `open` unambiguous, and adjusted six tactic calls that the newer toolchain rejects.",
